{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_1_level_main_01-06_beg",
  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-06",
  "title": "災害",
  "storyCode": "1-6",
  "avgTag": "戦闘前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dda5b05c4ec6cc484f70056995dea48c3b2cef18cb38e33fa85f7da53dd244f2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第九关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "うん。そういうわけで、ロドスの連中は、追跡されてることにまだ気付いてないんだってさ。ファウストのところから戻った伝令が、色々教えてくれたんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "あいつら、都市の外周近くのエリアで立ち往生してるらしいよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "虫けら風情が、天災の混乱に乗じて逃げ出そうとでも思ってるみたいだけど……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "チェルノボーグの状況を知られた以上、取り逃がしたら計画の妨げになるかもしれないし。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メフィスト",
      "speakerToken": "char_1507_Mephisto_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "portraitKey": "char_1507_Mephisto",
      "text": "ひと思いに殺しちゃってもいいと思うんだけど、どうかなあ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "こ、この……チェルノボーグのクズどもめ……！　お、お前らが……お前らが、俺たち感染者をこんなふうにしたんだああっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "――邪魔だッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "うぐっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "次から次へと……！　命知らずの連中め！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "……様子がおかしい。奴らはなぜ狂乱状態に陥っているんだ……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "それも気になるところだが……この場所に、これほど多くの部隊が配置されている理由も掴めんな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "合理的に考えれば、ここを守る必要があるとは思えん。常軌を逸した采配だ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――総員、引き下がらずに前へと進め！　レユニオンを撃退し、撤退ルートを切り開くんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_011_talula_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_011_talula",
      "portraitKey": "char_011_talula",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "あれが「ロドス」か？　フッ……実に勇ましいものだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クラウンスレイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "な、なんなの……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "……っ、落石か！？　この忙しい時に……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "気を取られるな！　防衛ラインを維持するんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "――！　待った、ち、違う……！　落石なんかじゃない……！　崩れたビルの、破片が降ってきてるんだ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "何？　それはどういう――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "は、ハハッ……アッハハハハ！　来た、来たぞ！　ついにこの時が来たんだ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "い、イイ、イヒヒヒッ……！！　救いの時だ！　感染者は救われ、ほかの連中は全員粛清されるんだ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "あは、ハ……あはは、アハハハハ――ぐ、うっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "ひ、ヒヒ、ヒヒヒヒッ――ぎ……あ、アアアッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "なッ……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "あの連中……なぜ倒れたんだ……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "……味方の攻撃、か？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "それとも――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――ドーベルマンさん！　空が……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "ッ、これは……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "空が、血のように紅く――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "――「煮えたぎる雲が、焔へと転じる時」……まるで、あの一節のような……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "皆、慌てず行動しろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ニアール",
      "speakerToken": "char_148_nearl_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_148_nearl",
      "portraitKey": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "……！　彼の言う通りだ！　全員、まずは自分の身を守ってくれ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "……まだ、終わりじゃない……！　生き延びる方法は、必ずあるはずだ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "――「大地は沈黙し、恐怖が人々の声を奪う」。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "「されば、大いなる源石が天より下り」――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "――「死の落とす灼熱の影へと墜ちていく」。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クラウンスレイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "……タルラ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クラウンスレイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "命令をくれ。――何をすればいい？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――この天災を生き延びる者もあるやもしれん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "タルラ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "生存者がいたら、全員始末しろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クラウンスレイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns",
      "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
      "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
      "text": "了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "レユニオンの連中は、天災を利用して復讐を果たそうとしているのだとばかり思っていたが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "まさか、チェルノボーグすべての破壊をもくろんでいたとは――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "これは単なる復讐というより、宣戦布告と見るべきか……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ドーベルマン",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "奴らは、感染者の時代を作ろうとでもしているのか……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "こ……こんなことって……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "まるで……空が、落ちてくるみたい……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "！？　おい、どうした！　ぼんやりするな、危ないぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "……あれ、は……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "しっかりしてください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医療オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "――あ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "彼女を連れて、少しでも安全な場所へ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "前衛オペレーター",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "了解！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerToken": "char_014_riope",
      "operatorId": "char_014_riope",
      "portraitKey": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "全員、今すぐ退避しろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "みなさん！　天災に、備えてください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
